# Internal docs — kept in the repo, never deployed to the public site.
#
# NOTE: do NOT use a blanket *.md rule on this site. build.js reads
# insights/articles/*.md as build INPUTS and compiles them to
# articles.json. A wildcard would break the Insights section.
# Root-anchored paths only.
/README.md

